{"id":"23118ae31a51c5a6","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-cat2-locally-small-category.md","title":"ZFC Cat2 Locally Small Category","display":"df-zfc-cat2-locally-small-category — ZFC Cat2 Locally Small Category","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat2-locally-small-category","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat2-locally-small-category"],"display":"df-zfc-cat2-locally-small-category — ZFC Cat2 Locally Small Category","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat2-locally-small-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat2-locally-small-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat2-locally-small-category — ZFC Cat2 Locally Small Category"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2LocallySmallCategory}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2LocallySmallCategory}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (category predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}locally\\text{-}small\\text{-}category} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCat2LocallySmallCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}locally\\text{-}small\\text{-}category} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCat2LocallySmallCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The upstream category predicate is restricted to set-coded categories. Hence every hom-collection is a subset of the set-coded morphism carrier and is automatically a set; local smallness is therefore equivalent to being a category in this universe.</li>\n<li>No class-valued hom operator is postulated: such an operator is absent from the upstream category signature and would add hidden structure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S\\subseteq V$ (category predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-category.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2LocallySmallCategory}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}locally\\text{-}small\\text{-}category} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCat2LocallySmallCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)","display":true}],"bytes":1209,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-327","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-cat2-locally-small-category]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1584","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-cat2-locally-small-category.md|58-df-zfc-cat2-locally-small-category]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a87b7e1119b63b2c"]}